#: usr/share/fish-tweak-tool/ftt_gui.py:114
msgid ""
"<b>Starship</b> — a fast, highly-customisable cross-shell prompt (a single "
"Rust binary, not a fisher plugin). Applying installs the <tt>starship</tt> "
"package if needed and enables it via <tt>starship init fish</tt>.\n"
"\n"
"<b>First steps:</b> configure it in <tt>~/.config/starship.toml</tt>; browse "
"presets and modules:"
msgstr ""
"<b>Starship</b>, un prompt rápido y muy personalizable para distintos shells "
"(un único binario de Rust, no un plugin de fisher). Al aplicarlo, instala el "
"paquete <tt>starship</tt> si hace falta y lo activa mediante <tt>starship "
"init fish</tt>.\n"
"\n"
"<b>Primeros pasos:</b> configúralo en <tt>~/.config/starship.toml</tt>; "
"explora los presets y módulos:"

